<p begin="2.705" end="6.371" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2.705" end="3.009">ど</span><span begin="3.009" end="3.361">れ</span><span begin="3.361" end="3.529">ほ</span><span begin="3.529" end="3.977">ど</span><span begin="3.977" end="4.337">よ</span><span begin="4.337" end="4.513">か</span><span begin="4.513" end="4.689">っ</span><span begin="4.689" end="4.873">た</span><span begin="4.873" end="5.309">で</span><span begin="5.309" end="5.647">し</span><span begin="5.647" end="5.985">ょ</span><span begin="5.986" end="6.371">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那该有多好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">do re ho do yo ka &apos;t ta de sho u</span></p>
<p begin="6.707" end="11.731" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.707" end="7.083">未</span><span begin="7.083" end="7.659">だ</span><span begin="7.659" end="8.083">に</span><span begin="8.083" end="8.259">あ</span><span begin="8.259" end="8.427">な</span><span begin="8.427" end="9.091">た</span><span begin="9.091" end="9.411">の</span><span begin="9.411" end="9.604">こ</span><span begin="9.604" end="9.771">と</span><span begin="9.771" end="10.267">を</span><span begin="10.267" end="10.811">夢</span><span begin="10.811" end="11.019">に</span><span begin="11.019" end="11.180">み</span><span begin="11.180" end="11.731">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你依旧出现在我梦里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i ma da ni a na ta no ko to wo yu me ni mi ru</span></p>
<p begin="12.235" end="17.357" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.235" end="12.587">忘</span><span begin="12.587" end="12.915">れ</span><span begin="12.915" end="13.091">た</span><span begin="13.091" end="13.931">物</span><span begin="13.931" end="14.307">を</span><span begin="14.307" end="14.459">取</span><span begin="14.459" end="14.963">り</span><span begin="14.963" end="15.300">に</span><span begin="15.300" end="15.860">帰</span><span begin="15.860" end="16.323">る</span><span begin="16.323" end="16.495">よ</span><span begin="16.495" end="16.667">う</span><span begin="16.667" end="17.357">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就像取回遗忘的东西一样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wa su re ta mo no wo to ri ni ka e ru yo u ni</span></p></div></body></tt>